# laser.xrs - the aim laser is a quad layer, so it is INVISIBLE to game-shot.ps1.
# This is the only way to check it without a headset.
#
# Expect layersLastFrame to jump by the number of laser dots plus the aim dot.
# Compare against a game-shot of the same moment: the laser must be ABSENT there
# and PRESENT here. That contrast is the proof the capability is new.
reset
@mod vraim on
@mod vraim laser on
@frames 60
@assert layersLastFrame ge 3
@shot laser_on
@mod vraim laser off
@frames 60
@shot laser_off
